# Default phone tilt where browser permission allows

Status: DONE PUBLIC
Milestone: M83 Automatic entrance tilt with honest permission fallback
Dependencies: 87_VISIBLE_GLASS_ETCHING.todo

## Tasks

- [x] Preserve the existing entrance controller and tilt tests.
- [x] Start tilt once automatically on an eligible phone when no permission gesture is required.
- [x] Keep permission-gated browsers on the existing explicit tap-to-approve action.
- [x] Preserve calibration, opt-out, missing-data fallback and entry/preference cleanup.
- [x] Extend the current unit and mobile-emulated browser checks.
- [x] Finish current86/87live reviews before rebuilding their generated snapshot.
