- [x] Publish and check the resulting live behavior.

## Acceptance criteria

- No automatic permission prompt or attempt to bypass a browser gesture requirement.
- Ordinary supported phones begin listening/calibrating without tapping Phone tilt.
- Explicitly turning tilt off stays off across layout changes; no automatic retry loop.
- No sensor data stored/uploaded and no audio activation caused by tilt.
- Direct links, reduced motion, short screens, backgrounding, Skip and Enter remain safe.
- Actual device support is not claimed from synthetic browser tests.

